{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"status\":\"assessed\",\"reason\":\"Se observan plantas compatibles con soja, con hojas ovaladas de borde liso y disposición en hileras, junto con gramíneas de hojas estrechas y plantas de hojas dentadas o lobuladas distinguibles como malezas. Los contornos delimitan superficies visibles identificables.\",\"limitations\":[\"La perspectiva y la pérdida de detalle hacia el horizonte impiden separar allí cultivo y malezas.\",\"La superposición de hojas impide delimitar partes ocultas; no se reconstruyen.\",\"Los contornos son aproximados y no exhaustivos: algunas plántulas pequeñas, tallos finos y bordes ambiguos quedan sin marcar.\"],\"polygons\":[[[859,739],[848,719],[840,697],[834,681],[839,663],[846,667],[849,651],[858,656],[866,640],[875,646],[886,641],[888,652],[903,641],[914,648],[911,669],[901,692],[886,716],[870,737]],[[850,738],[832,729],[816,718],[800,708],[785,690],[783,678],[798,681],[813,692],[828,704],[841,721]],[[900,751],[912,734],[928,726],[940,724],[943,715],[955,719],[964,710],[978,714],[990,708],[997,717],[987,729],[972,736],[958,738],[945,748],[925,752]],[[923,760],[936,765],[947,777],[945,785],[955,790],[955,801],[965,807],[965,825],[951,821],[943,811],[930,802],[929,788],[920,776]],[[873,793],[855,784],[841,784],[830,780],[817,787],[804,787],[786,780],[775,788],[789,800],[803,806],[819,806],[832,813],[849,809],[865,805]],[[887,820],[898,819],[910,827],[921,831],[923,841],[914,850],[907,848],[902,839],[892,837]],[[930,751],[931,739],[936,726],[940,730],[945,746],[942,755],[934,760]],[[576,901],[585,868],[597,833],[610,795],[623,755],[635,711],[645,673],[638,718],[629,760],[617,803],[605,839],[591,876]],[[583,840],[603,809],[623,782],[644,764],[668,752],[694,748],[721,750],[745,757],[768,769],[741,763],[713,758],[687,758],[665,765],[643,778],[623,801],[603,828]],[[607,795],[601,774],[590,749],[578,727],[563,709],[545,695],[526,685],[551,693],[571,706],[587,723],[600,74